<title>USA: Tandy board increases share buyback.</title>
<headline>Tandy board increases share buyback.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tandy Corp said on Monday its board had authorized the repurchase of another five million common shares under an existing stock buyback program.</p>
<p>The increase brings the total authorization to 10 million shares, of which about three million were repurchased during the first five months of 1996, Tandy said.</p>
<p>The buyback program, authorized in December 1995, calls for purchases to be made in the open market from time to time and does not have an expiration date, Tandy said.</p>
